WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.460
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.410
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.230
Then I'm off, Ichigo.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.820
Good luck at work.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.600
Thanks!

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.990
Are they filming for her drama again today?

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:24.080
Yeah, and it looks like she's getting more screentime too.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.920
"<i>Naughty Detective</i> is capturing the 
hearts of fans around the world!" {Wikipedia says titles of TV series are italicized and individual episode names are quoted}

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.850
It's says it's got an exclusive interview 
with the two newcomers.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.890
Isn't it great? Aoi's turned completely into a real actress.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.010
Hey! Starmiya and Shibuki!

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.020
Come on and join us.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.440
Hi, signalize!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:07.800
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:07.800
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.690
No, that's wrong

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.690
iie chigau yo

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.070
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.070
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:16.860
Do that signalize!

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:22.040
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:22.040
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.000
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.000
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.540
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.540
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.710
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.710
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.050
Chance for me

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:41.350
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:41.350
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:45.560
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:45.560
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:50.440
Where are we headed?

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:50.440
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.230
Into a brilliant hope

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.230
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:01:54.820 --> 00:02:01.490
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:01:54.820 --> 00:02:01.490
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.830
Where we're headed

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.830
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:08.710
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:08.710
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:16.090
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:16.090
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.450
A movie audition?

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:28.460
Yes, you four will be taking this movie audition.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:32.590
"<i>Stylish Thieves Swallowtail: The Movie</i>"?

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.590
That sounds cool!

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:39.230
And for such a special movie there will be a Special Audition!

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:44.350
If the four of you honeys don't work together, you'll have no chance of passing.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.970
Work together?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.290
And, only two will be chosen!

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.270
Only a pair of you, yeah!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:56.110
Even though we have to work together, 
only two will be chosen?

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:01.010
It means that we'll be working together
 as rivals. Let's all do our best!

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.450
You're right. There's no point in thinking about it too hard.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.730
Let's all focus our energy and aim to pass the audition.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:08.630
Yes!

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:13.250
If you dare to hold Yurika-sama back, I'll suck your blood.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.330
Got it! I'll work hard so that you won't suck my blood!

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:19.130
O-Oh really. As long as you understand.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.640
What?!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:32.650
Really?! Is <i>Swallowtail</i> really going to come back?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.900
Y-yeah. So you know what <i>Swallowtail</i> is, huh.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.830
Of course! It's common sense!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:45.160
I shouldn't have doubted that the Idol Professor would know about a drama from before we were born.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:49.650
Once I heard about that legendary idol drama I had no choice but to watch it.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:52.600
I got totally hooked on it right away!

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:57.300
A mysterious organization attempts to monopolize Aikatsu cards from around the world.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:02.870
The mastermind claims that all the world's fashion and all the world's Aikatsu cards belong to her.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:05.630
She's a selfish princess character.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.820
"We won't be able to answer our fans expectations like this..."

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:13.850
The idols whose cards were stolen sink into depression.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:17.400
That is, until their saviors suddenly make their appearance.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.560
They are the Stylish Thieves Swallowtail. {make plural?}

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:28.290
It was thanks to this drama that the newly-formed Masquerade became popular nationwide.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.750
I know, they were so cool!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.760
They're floating just like butterflies! Awesome!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.430
Those two are...

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.940
They're Masquerade.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.010
Masquerade? Oh!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:55.140
This is the legendary idol unit, Masquerade.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:05:00.960
Correct. Miya and I starred in this drama— 
it was Masquerade's masterpiece.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:04.650
They've decided to remake it as a movie.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:07.870
And you're saying that <i>we're</i> 
going to be in such a great story...

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.660
Excuse me, is Mizuki-san not going to take this audition?

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:16.460
She is not. Mizuki is busy preparing for her role as the heroine in a historical play

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.790
that will be opened next year.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.550
Wow!

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:24.000
I can't wait to see Mizuki-san in a kimono!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:30.300
Moreover, the director specifically requested that only new idols try out for <i>Swallowtail</i>.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:35.310
So that means this is a huge chance 
for us first-year idols, right?

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:38.490
Oh, I doubt you people will make it.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:43.140
Only Yurika-sama herself is fit to 
continue the legend of Masquerade.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.560
Can you really say all that even after watching them?

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.470
Th-They're pretty good, for a couple of humans.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:01.460
The key to passing this audition is most likely in the action.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.590
Thank you very much!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:12.040
Now I can give my fans the greatest concert of their lives.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:23.230
Stylish Thieves Swallowtail!

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.060
Thank goodness!

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:30.240
Aye! Now she can shower her fans with love!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:38.730
Ichigo, you have to pass this audition!

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.540
Wh-Why are you so serious, Aoi?

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.660
You're going to be part of Swallowtail, Ichigo.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:48.170
As your number one fan, there's nothing 
that could be more exciting.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.310
Aoi...

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:52.770
I really wish I could've taken the audition with you,

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:55.430
but I'll use that extra energy for supporting you.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:59.490
Thanks! I'll take those feelings and 
pass the Special Audition!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:07.150
In the drama Special Audition, 
everyone needs to work together,

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:10.200
and your teamwork is evaluated.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.080
If one fails, then everyone does.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.210
If only one passes, then nobody does.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:21.520
The key to passing lies in your teamwork.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:26.500
You must deepen your bonds like 
the original "Swallowtail" did

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.760
and make your hearts as one

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.840
in order to open the path for success.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:42.270
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.270
Hey, could you get up and join us already?

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.990
How rude. I'm always serious about my work.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:53.560
Don't you know how dangerous sunlight is to vampires?

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:58.040
Though I doubt that someone like you who can bathe in ultraviolet rays all day could possibly understand.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.920
It's not like <i>we're</i> immune either...

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.080
And besides, isn't <i>that</i> an issue?

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.180
Ah, my leg!

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:09.240
Yurika-chan, are you okay?

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.750
It's not a problem since it was under three seconds.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.180
Thank god.

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:17.110
Listen, I haven't said anything about 
your character up until now,

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:20.730
but if you don't train alongside us, 
our teamwork is going to suffer.

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.600
Training? Teamwork?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:30.120
That sort of filthy activity is unnecessary for a being who has surpassed you lowly humans, such as myself.

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.240
It looks like I've been under the sun for too long.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.570
I must go recover my powers of darkness.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.600
Farewell everyone, have a nice night.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:39.290
Yurika-chan...

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.200
You're going home? Yurika-chan?

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.660
It's hard to get through to her.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.100
Let's keep going with the three of us.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.130
But...

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:55.470
And soon, the day of the Special Audition came upon us.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:58.470
Good to see you again, Director Kurosaki.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.970
We'll be in your care today.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:04.770
I wonder how many years it's been since our last meeting.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.480
Hime—no, perhaps I should call you Mitsuishi-kun now.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:12.900
It feels a bit strange to have you call me by that name.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.000
At least he seems like a nice person.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.770
Aye, he has a soft feeling. {i'd like to use aura, but that becomes important next episode, so...}

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.740
That's what you'd normally think, right?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.860
I remember as if it was yesterday.

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.940
Though Miya and I knew not the first thing about acting

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:26.500
you thoroughly trained us both.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.500
Yes, it was because I sensed the willpower in you. {nah, I won't use guts here}

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:34.830
Though we were so weak that we cried almost every day,

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:38.260
you taught us so many valuable lessons.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.340
The headmistress cried?

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:46.040
Director Kurosaki. Although he appears kind, he's extremely strict when it comes to work.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.770
He's famous for raising newcomers into total pros.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.770
Hey there.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:57.150
Today's Special Audition might prove to be a bit difficult, but give it your best shot.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.180
W-We will.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:01.530
Well then, let's get started.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.720
Now, here is your mission.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:28.450
I want you to recover a certain item kept in a banquet hall deep within this castle. {room name?}

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.730
A "certain item"?

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:34.820
Mizuki-chan?

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:39.200
The outfit I was going to use for 
tonight's concert was stolen from me.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:42.890
Please! Please get my Aikatsu cards back!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.700
I'm bound to disappoint my fans if something isn't done.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:48.230
So they're going with this kind of scenario.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.120
We're the thieves,

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:54.050
and our mission is to get back Mizuki-san's Aikatsu cards.

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:00.900
We can't let her fans down.

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:05.010
Yeah, let's get the cards back for 
both Mizuki-chan and her fans sakes.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.020
Ready, start.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.220
Let's begin the skill evaluation.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:18.030
Please go easy on them... is what I'd like to say, but it won't change your mind.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.300
I wish you girls luck.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:49.860
Wh-What do we do?!

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:51.190
Stick to the walls and let it pass by.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.490
Now <i>that's</i> something for a Special Audition.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:00.350
The props are really well made.

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:01.600
Come on, let's go!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.620
I-It was real?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.790
Let's get a move on! Mizuki-chan's 
Aikatsu cards are calling for us.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:14.830
Wait up!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.590
You can't tell where any of the traps are!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:17.840
Run!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:22.090
P-Please don't...

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:38.400
I don't remember being told that my
 life was on the line in this audition.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.030
I can't go on!

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.640
That's why I told you to train!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.220
Shut it, you.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:57.540
To Yurika-sama, the descendant 
of vampires, traps of this level are...

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:05.180
That was dangerous.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.640
Yurika!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.910
I've wandered the human lands 
for over six hundred years,

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.670
but I suppose that ends tonight.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:26.190
Now I can finally enter my true eternal rest.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.910
Yurika, don't give up!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.340
Why'd you let go?!
That really hurt, you know!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.810
You're letting your true face show.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.150
If you keep fooling around like this I'll suck your blood.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:48.090
Ichigo, Otome! Stop running around randomly.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.010
Huh?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:49.850
What?

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:59.000
Ichigo, stop running!!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:11.240
There're a bunch of scary looking guys!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.150
We need to be careful not to let them catch us.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:18.490
But, but it looks like we need to go this way if we want to get deeper in the castle.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:22.030
That <i>is</i> true... what do we do, Ran?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.770
I don't know, maybe one of us could be bait...

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.440
Come, it's time to depart.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:34.720
Yurika-chan?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.600
The rest of you should hurry up and change.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.400
You were invited by the princess?

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:46.650
That's right. I, Yurika-sama, was personally invited to come.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.560
Stop standing around like fools and open the way.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:50.660
However...

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:53.580
Just who do you think I am?

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.710
I share blood with <i>the</i> Count Dracula,

00:14:55.710 --> 00:15:00.080
and am thus a descendant of vampires. 
If you dare offend Yurika-sama

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.810
I'll drink every last drop of your blood,

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:05.550
no matter how full my stomach should get.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:10.190
She's drifting a bit from her thief role,
 but that's very realistic acting.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:11.390
Toudou...

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:14.110
Move aside, Yurika-sama is passing.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.830
Open the way.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.180
Yurika-chan's pretty amazing.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.940
Yeah, she's acting like a real princess.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:26.180
Do you understand now? This is an <i>acting</i> audition.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:29.190
There was no point to your filthy training.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.340
Are you really sure

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.950
that there was no point to that "filthy training"?

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.140
Shut up!

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:45.210
If only tonight was a full moon, I'd be able to use my powers to transform into a bat...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.340
Yurika-chan, hang in there.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.710
You're almost there.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.090
I-I can't...

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.230
Yurika!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.820
You can't give up now!

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:04.070
This is for Mizuki-chan, as well as 
all the fans waiting for her.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:06.180
Does Hoshimiya spark your interest?

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:09.660
Not particularly. I'm simply giving them all fair assessment.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:15.620
It seems as though Shibuki-kun and Toudou-kun hold the key to passing this audition.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.320
The question is now whether they'll realize or not.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:21.790
You alright?

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:26.450
Y-Yes. I'll make an exception and 
express my thanks to you.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.340
Geez.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.850
Ichigo-tan.

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:29.600
Right.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.020
You're the girls from earlier!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.210
Sorry, everyone.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:47.900
There's nothing you could've done, it was a trap that went off whenever the card was taken.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.550
Anyway, we need a way out...

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:55.320
I've prepared a hot air balloon for your 
escape on the balcony. Hurry!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.070
Don't let them escape!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.210
Go!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.300
I knew you'd come here.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:21.450
I've seen straight through your 
behavioral patterns with my profiling.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:25.100
If you don't want to get hurt, 
I'd suggest you turn yourselves in.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.730
Naughty Detectives...

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.360
I didn't know this was a collaboration.

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.530
You can tell us all about it at the station.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.570
We can't let ourselves be caught now!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:36.110
There are people who are waiting for this card!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.210
No matter the reason, stealing is a crime.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:42.790
In the name of the Crescent Moon Atelier, you're under arrest!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.990
Sorry for stepping on your heads!

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:51.800
Otome is in a hurry!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.010
Not bad.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:00.970
Got'cha!

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:03.480
Criminal apprehended!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.360
With this, we're even.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.050
You've been quite the handful.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.540
But it's the end of the line for you!

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.370
Now come here and give yourself in!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.130
I won't give up!

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:25.870
No matter what happens to me, 
I'm getting this card to Mizuki-chan!

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:31.020
Hoshimiya and Kiriya... those two are the best of friends.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:36.840
And yet, they are now the worst of
 enemies, a thief and policeman...

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.890
They're quite good.

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.920
Ichigo-tan!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:53.150
Oh no!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.070
Good, that's everyone...

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.970
W-We're too heavy?

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:04.910
Not when we've come this far...

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.160
We'll all fail if we're caught...

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:11.180
It's no good! We keep on sinking...

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.210
We can't even run away...

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.170
It's not over yet!

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:16.510
Ran, take this!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.420
I leave the rest to you.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.930
But then the audition...

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:24.740
Please deliver a lovely concert to Mizuki-chan's fans.

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:29.330
Go! You'd better make sure to make 
Mizuki-chan's dreams come true!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.980
Please! Please get my Aikatsu cards back.

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:43.070
I'm bound to disappoint my fans if something isn't done.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:46.670
Ichigo and Otome have 
shouldered Mizuki-san's feelings...

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:50.580
Looks like the two of us had 
forgotten something important.

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.990
Why didn't you run away?

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:58.910
I couldn't bear to abandon my 
precious friends in a place like this.

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:04.850
The four of us <i>together</i> are going to bring those Aikatsu cards to Mizuki-san.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.470
Alright! Let's do this!

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.680
Cut!

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.480
Good job, everyone.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.860
You did well despite the difficulty.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.610
This ends the audition.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:29.750
The Mastery of Acting!

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:33.500
Acting is to take upon oneself another's life.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:38.000
You must understand that there is a meaning to each and every movement of your fingers.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.510
Congratulations. You splendidly 
passed the Special Audition.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.260
Thank you very much.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.130
You did it, Ichigo!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.100
Thanks!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:51.110
Looks like you managed to get
 the Mastery of Acting before me.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.770
The Mastery of Acting...

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.030
You got it too!

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.990
That was terrific acting, Kiriya-kun.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.490
Thank you very much!

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:11.790
Now then, it's time to announce the two of you who will be starring in <i>Swallowtail.</i>

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.510
Guided by the scent of adventure...{thrill, whatever}

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.430
We are the gracefully fluttering butterflies...

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.930
Stylish Thieves Swallowtail!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:35.150
Though we may look sweet, we're burning with spice! {huh, not as bad as I thought it would be}

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.190
Cut!

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:41.690
During the audition, Ichigo and Otome

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:46.610
were wishing solely to deliver happiness to idols and their fans, no matter the danger.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:49.630
They truly were the reincarnation 
of the Swallowtail Thieves.

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:52.620
I hate to admit it, but they're the best girls for the part.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:58.470
They assumed Swallowtail's true emotions long before either of us realized it.

00:21:58.470 --> 00:21:59.380
Yeah.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.480
Are you girls satisfied with that last take?

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.760
If so, then you've let me down.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.800
We're not, please let us do it again!

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:10.840
We're the Thieves Swallowtail!

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:15.270
We'll do everything we can to deliver love to everyone!

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:18.020
Good. Let's try that one more time.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:19.210
Yes!

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:57.870
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.540
Have you finally started running?

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:01.300
That's right.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:02.880
Won't your parasol get in the way?

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:04.870
I'm a vampire, there's no helping it!

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:06.270
Then I'll hold it for you.

00:24:06.270 --> 00:24:07.500
Thanks...

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:10.010
Treasure teamwork.

00:24:10.710 --> 00:24:11.570
Sniff, sniff.

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:12.930
Raichi, what are you doing? {Ichigo, where's your ribbon?}

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:15.110
I'm practicing how to sniff out an idol!

00:24:15.110 --> 00:24:17.570
You don't have the right scent at all!

00:24:17.570 --> 00:24:18.420
What?

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:19.860
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:21.930
Idol Aura and Calendar Girl.

00:24:21.930 --> 00:24:24.150
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
